          <h2 id="lifecycle-title">Notes have a life, and an end</h2>
          <p class="answer">
            Nothing is written and forgotten. Every note moves through a
            deterministic lifecycle, decays on a schedule tied to how much you
            trust it, and can be restored if you delete it by mistake.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bento">
          <figure class="bento-card bento-span-12 figure reveal">
            <LifecycleDiagram />
            <figcaption>
              <code>confirmed</code> is the only state served by default. A
              deletion is a tombstone — <code>memory restore</code> brings it
              back.
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

