          <p class="eyebrow">Get started</p>
          <h2 id="install-title">One line. That's the whole setup.</h2>
          <p class="answer">
            Open a terminal in your project, paste the line, press enter. aimm
            finds the coding agents you already run and connects each one over
            MCP, with only the tools its task needs. Under a minute to first
            value.
          </p>
        </div>

        <ol class="bento install-steps">
